{"id":"5be99f4cb1597594","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-lem-uft.md","title":"Ultrafilter Theorem","display":"lem-uft — Ultrafilter Theorem","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-uft","aliases":["58-lem-uft"],"display":"lem-uft — Ultrafilter Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-uft"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-uft</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-uft — Ultrafilter Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-filter.md\">../batch15/58-df-filter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal F\">\\(X,\\mathcal F\\)</span> (集合与过滤器)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S,\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S,\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\)</span> (upstream predicates)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}uft} \\vdash \\mathrm{Filter}_S\\!\\left(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal P(X),\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(X)\\times\\mathcal P(X):A\\subseteq B\\}\\right)\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\mathcal F\\to\\exists U\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,X)\\land\\mathcal F\\subseteq U\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}uft} \\vdash \\mathrm{Filter}_S\\!\\left(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal P(X),\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(X)\\times\\mathcal P(X):A\\subseteq B\\}\\right)\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\mathcal F\\to\\exists U\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,X)\\land\\mathcal F\\subseteq U\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The inclusion order supplied to the poset-filter predicate is explicitly restricted to the set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(X)\\times\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal P(X)\\times\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span>. In ZFC the result follows from Zorn's lemma; over ZF it is strictly weaker than full choice.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-filter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S,\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}uft} \\vdash \\mathrm{Filter}_S\\!\\left(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal P(X),\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(X)\\times\\mathcal P(X):A\\subseteq B\\}\\right)\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\mathcal F\\to\\exists U\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,X)\\land\\mathcal F\\subseteq U\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(X)\\times\\mathcal P(X)","display":false}],"bytes":997,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3925","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-lem-uft.md|58-lem-uft]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","1331244a5201bb99","2b6b1d9eb78a2714"]}